rform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\">Perform (Lute)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Scale\" title=\"Chromatic Scale\">Chromatic Scale</a>: Can be purchased from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_C._Quirkilious\" title=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/25px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/38px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/50px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png/25px-Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Thomas_C._Quirkilious.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_C._Quirkilious\" title=\"Thomas C. Quirkilious\">Thomas C. Quirkilious</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The \"Ahndri Stolyarof\" referred to in the description is likely a reference to real-world composer and music theory professor <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@darushkii/playlists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Andrey Stolyarov\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-ic